---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section process-section" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow centered-eyebrow"><span></span> GETTING STARTED <span></span></p>
      <h2>Your first step is simple.</h2>
      <p>You do not need to know all the terminology, buy equipment, or commit to a full training program before reaching out.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="process-grid">
      <li class="reveal">
        <span class="step-number">01</span>
        <div class="step-icon"><Icon name="mail" size={26} /></div>
        <h3>Get in touch</h3>
        <p>Share your experience level, goals, availability, and any questions about getting started.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal reveal-1">
        <span class="step-number">02</span>
        <div class="step-icon"><Icon name="clock" size={26} /></div>
        <h3>Schedule a lesson</h3>
        <p>Choose a time, confirm the airport and aircraft details, and receive simple arrival instructions.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="reveal reveal-2">
        <span class="step-number">03</span>
        <div class="step-icon"><Icon name="plane" size={26} /></div>
        <h3>Take the controls</h3>
        <p>Meet Tyler, complete a preflight briefing, and begin learning in the airplane.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
